00:06:05.329 --> 00:06:08.222
But what also matters is how
you're gonna communicate it

00:06:08.222 --> 00:06:10.231
and in what form are
you gonna monetize it?

00:06:10.231 --> 00:06:12.475
Do you wanna put out a show
where you answer questions,

00:06:12.475 --> 00:06:14.299
or put out content, or tell stories,

00:06:14.299 --> 00:06:15.428
but then how are you gonna monetize it?

00:06:15.428 --> 00:06:16.428
Advertising?

00:06:16.428 --> 00:06:19.365
I mean, there's just so
many open-ended questions

00:06:19.365 --> 00:06:21.577
that need to be asked of you

00:06:21.577 --> 00:06:24.292
based on your question, but
here's what I would say.

00:06:24.292 --> 00:06:26.685
There's a lot of ways to make money.

00:06:26.685 --> 00:06:28.591
You could have subscription,
you can have coaching,

00:06:28.591 --> 00:06:30.613
you can sell content,
you can sell advertising,

00:06:30.613 --> 00:06:33.286
you can build up equity
by putting out content

00:06:33.286 --> 00:06:35.006
and putting on a conference.

00:06:35.006 --> 00:06:36.332
There's a ton of ways.

00:06:36.332 --> 00:06:39.754
I really do think I'm one
of the golden examples

00:06:39.754 --> 00:06:43.264
of how to make money
without directly selling it.

00:06:43.264 --> 00:06:45.924
Meaning, again, there's a
lot of my contemporaries

00:06:45.924 --> 00:06:48.625
who sell eBooks, or white papers,

00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:50.725
or access to their VIP place.

00:06:50.725 --> 00:06:52.211
I do none such things.

00:06:52.211 --> 00:06:54.678
I put out the content at
scale, hence, this show,

00:06:54.678 --> 00:06:56.694
but then it builds brand
leverage that allows me

00:06:56.694 --> 00:06:58.547
to charge a lot of money to public speak,

00:06:58.547 --> 00:06:59.790
or when my book comes out,

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.719
it allows me to have a big
fan base to get a leverage

00:07:01.719 --> 00:07:04.009
of a big upfront, where I
don't even need all the books

00:07:04.009 --> 00:07:07.042
to sell, though I wanna
fulfill that contract.

00:07:07.042 --> 00:07:09.295
It gave me the leverage to
start a social media agency

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:11.387
with my brand equity that
then I operated around.

00:07:11.387 --> 00:07:12.527
There's a lot of ways to make money.

00:07:12.527 --> 00:07:14.328
You've got to decide how.

00:07:14.328 --> 00:07:16.130
If that's even your goal,
I'm making the assumption

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.015
'cause this is a business-oriented show,

00:07:18.015 --> 00:07:20.260
but it's all about content, baby.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:23.154
It's all about content,
and what you're putting out

00:07:23.154 --> 00:07:24.176
matters in two forms.

00:07:24.176 --> 00:07:26.881
One, is it valuable to an audience?

00:07:26.881 --> 00:07:29.845
Value's subjective, but two,
how do you want to communicate?

00:07:29.845 --> 00:07:30.764
Is it video form?

00:07:30.764 --> 00:07:31.673
Is it audio form?

00:07:31.673 --> 00:07:34.715
