York, or what's that guy,

00:07:38.409 --> 00:07:38.976
People of New York?

00:07:38.976 --> 00:07:39.581
- [Voiceover] Humans of New York.

00:07:39.581 --> 00:07:40.246
- Humans of New York!

00:07:40.246 --> 00:07:41.502
That was just pictures on Instagram

00:07:41.502 --> 00:07:43.271
