00:10:11.498 --> 00:10:13.218
Yes, but what am i trying to achieve

00:10:13.218 --> 00:10:16.610
in trying to find
like-minded business, hustle,

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.819
growing your base and be
appreciative, gratitude people,

00:10:19.819 --> 00:10:22.084
I'm trying to grow more of my audience.

00:10:22.084 --> 00:10:23.143
You may get a million views

00:10:23.143 --> 00:10:25.535
on that penguin jumping off a tree,

00:10:25.535 --> 00:10:27.487
but did they stay for your fitness?

00:10:27.487 --> 00:10:30.002
If they don't, then you
