00:10:31.134 --> 00:10:33.215
- Hey Gary, I'm sick today,

00:10:33.215 --> 00:10:35.493
and I was just curious
if you ever get sick.

00:10:35.493 --> 00:10:38.397
Maybe you really are Bionic Man.

00:10:38.397 --> 00:10:41.475
If you do get sick,
how do you handle that?

00:10:41.475 --> 00:10:43.996
How do you hustle when you're sick?

00:10:43.996 --> 00:10:44.852
Really sick.

00:10:45.357 --> 00:10:47.541
- Ryan, first of all,
hope you feel better.

00:10:47.541 --> 00:10:49.409
I mean you look like shit in that video.

00:10:53.828 --> 00:10:55.942
First of all, big shout
out to Lizzie Vaynerchuk

00:10:55.942 --> 00:10:58.056
because in the last 11 years
that I've been married,

00:10:58.056 --> 00:10:59.371
I have not been sick.

00:10:59.371 --> 00:11:00.404
I think that has a lot to do with the fact

00:11:00.404 --> 00:11:02.903
that Lizzie tries to
get me to wash my hands

00:11:02.903 --> 00:11:05.007
and the fact that I don't
have a weird draft coming in

00:11:05.007 --> 00:11:06.565
like I had in my old apartment,

00:11:06.565 --> 00:11:07.859
which I think caught me a couple times.

00:11:07.859 --> 00:11:08.666
I mean...

00:11:09.357 --> 00:11:11.732
You're talking to a old
school Eastern European kid

00:11:11.732 --> 00:11:13.961
who actually thinks that
getting sick and being sick

00:11:13.961 --> 00:11:15.601
is actually psychology.

00:11:15.601 --> 00:11:17.706
I think the brain is
the most powerful tool.

00:11:17.706 --> 00:11:20.273
Like, I know the answer
to this is not true,

00:11:20.273 --> 00:11:21.644
but I do feel like...

00:11:21.644 --> 00:11:24.098
I'd be lying if I didn't
think there's some way

00:11:24.098 --> 00:11:26.679
that I'm stopping myself
from getting sick.

00:11:26.679 --> 00:11:29.178
In the same way that I used
to be able to get myself sick

00:11:29.178 --> 00:11:31.049
to get out of school,
and I don't mean like,

00:11:31.049 --> 00:11:31.991
"Oh, my tummy hurts."

00:11:31.991 --> 00:11:33.292
I mean,

00:11:33.292 --> 00:11:36.062
in this weird, yeah, I'm going somewhere.

00:11:36.062 --> 00:11:37.550
I've never said this out loud.

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.793
This is actually even
scary to say out loud.

00:11:39.793 --> 00:11:42.873
I'm so convinced that the
brain is this powerful,

00:11:42.873 --> 00:11:45.765
I used to be able to create a temperature,

00:11:45.765 --> 00:11:48.670
and I know that every logical
person, including myself,

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.959
I literally just said, "Bullshit,"

00:11:50.959 --> 00:11:51.867
but I saw it.

00:11:51.867 --> 00:11:53.908
I mean, and sure, sometimes,
I put it up to the lamp

00:11:53.908 --> 00:11:57.060
and that's how I did it, but
there was a couple of times

00:11:57.060 --> 00:11:59.043
where I would just psych my...

00:11:59.043 --> 00:12:00.822
Even right now, I just started doing it,

00:12:00.822 --> 00:12:02.021
and my stomach turned a little bit.

00:12:02.021 --> 00:12:02.811
I'm not kidding!

00:12:02.811 --> 00:12:04.684
Guys, the brain is a sick thing,

00:12:04.684 --> 00:12:07.633
so I guess the answer to
the final question is,

00:12:07.633 --> 00:12:09.526
you don't hustle when you get sick.

00:12:09.526 --> 00:12:11.984
In the same way you don't
hustle when you get sleep.

00:12:11.984 --> 00:12:13.583
We've got that quote card
that did really well, right?

00:12:13.583 --> 00:12:15.955
That quote where I'm like,
"It's not what you do,

00:12:15.955 --> 00:12:17.119
"it's not how many hours you're awake,

00:12:17.119 --> 00:12:18.362
"it's what you do within them."

00:12:18.362 --> 00:12:20.641
I'm thrilled to get six
or seven hours of sleep.

00:12:20.641 --> 00:12:22.945
I love when people think
I'm a three or four guy.

00:12:22.945 --> 00:12:24.887
I'll take eight every night,

00:12:24.887 --> 00:12:26.467
because in those other 16,

00:12:26.467 --> 00:12:27.990
I will dominate your face.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:31.334
I love people who sleep
four hours, but chill,

00:12:31.334 --> 00:12:33.848
and chilling is just not
doing something important

00:12:33.848 --> 00:12:37.588
for 40 minutes or having a
conversation on the trading floor

00:12:37.588 --> 00:12:38.867
for 30 minutes about the big game

00:12:38.867 --> 00:12:40.975
or what the fuck happened
in the Oscars last night?

00:12:40.975 --> 00:12:41.748
Who gives a shit?

00:12:41.748 --> 00:12:43.782
Execute, and so, but wait,

00:12:43.782 --> 00:12:46.199
who did this shit for me, I'm
purely focused on my thing.

00:12:46.199 --> 00:12:48.452
Some people like 30 minutes
of talking about the Oscars

00:12:48.452 --> 00:12:49.604
'cause it breaks up their day.

00:12:49.604 --> 00:12:50.662
That's their rest.

00:12:50.662 --> 00:12:53.241
You do you, but let me say this.

00:12:53.241 --> 00:12:55.865
When you're sick or when
you're sleeping, rest.

00:12:55.865 --> 00:12:58.361
Your body's telling you something, and so,

00:12:58.361 --> 00:13:01.498
like weirdly, maybe I was sick
once in the last 11 years,

00:13:01.498 --> 00:13:02.796
I was pumped.

00:13:03.604 --> 00:13:04.753
Let me just say that
again 'cause I don't know

00:13:04.753 --> 00:13:06.543
if everybody understood that.

00:13:06.543 --> 00:13:09.192
I weirdly wish I was
sick one day this year.

00:13:09.192 --> 00:13:10.808
I would really enjoy the time off.

00:13:10.808 --> 00:13:13.583
I'd enjoy relaxing, and the kids come.

00:13:13.583 --> 00:13:15.583
Misha comes home at three, it'd be fun!

00:13:15.583 --> 00:13:16.934
It'd be fun,

00:13:16.934 --> 00:13:18.494
but there's something subconsciously

00:13:18.494 --> 00:13:20.493
that's really trying to
not allow me to do that.

00:13:20.493 --> 00:13:22.887
In a world where I take
a hundred-plus flights,

00:13:22.887 --> 00:13:25.044
where that place is like, I don't know...

00:13:26.982 --> 00:13:28.291
Remember how a couple episodes,

00:13:28.291 --> 00:13:30.174
I said that the 20- to
30-year old Gary Vee

00:13:30.174 --> 00:13:31.279
is soft compared to me?

00:13:31.279 --> 00:13:32.303
That guy did get sick.

00:13:32.303 --> 00:13:33.408
Now I don't,

00:13:33.408 --> 00:13:35.615
and I do think it has a lot
to do with my focus on it,

00:13:35.615 --> 00:13:38.670
so I do think you can
out-hustle your sickness

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.982
to some degree, but
when you succumb to it,

00:13:40.982 --> 00:13:43.815
because at some level, we all do,

00:13:43.815 --> 00:13:46.077
I think you need to
just relax and enjoy it.

00:13:48.751 --> 00:13:49.600
Great.

